name chextras
category Package
revision 27118
shortdesc A companion package for the Swiss typesetter
relocated 1
longdesc The package simplifies the preparation of Swiss documents and
longdesc letters by setting up linguistic and common packages. While it
longdesc is a useful addition to the chletter document class, it is not
longdesc tied to it and may be used as a general purpose package.
